@startuml 3-11-wallet-auth-sequence
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #4A90D9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F4FD
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #999999
skinparam participantPadding 20
skinparam messageSpacing 30



actor "用户" as User
participant "前端" as FE
participant "MetaMask" as MM
participant "后端" as BE
database "Redis" as Redis
database "MySQL" as DB

== MetaMask签名登录 ==

User -> FE : 点击连接钱包
FE -> MM : 请求账户授权
MM -> FE : 返回钱包地址

FE -> BE : 请求挑战消息
BE -> Redis : 存储挑战(5分钟有效)
BE --> FE : 返回挑战消息

FE -> MM : 请求签名
MM -> FE : 返回签名

FE -> BE : 提交签名验证
BE -> BE : 验证签名

alt 验证通过
    BE -> DB : 查询或创建用户
    BE --> FE : 登录成功
else 验证失败
    BE --> FE : 认证失败
end

== 服务端钱包降级 ==

User -> FE : 选择服务端钱包登录
FE -> BE : 请求创建钱包
BE -> BE : 生成密钥对和助记词
BE -> DB : 创建用户并绑定钱包
BE --> FE : 返回令牌和钱包信息

@enduml